      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/CosplayManiaPH/status/2005836247965606037",
      "text": "LOOK: ⛩️ Cosplay Matsuri 2025 ⛩️ Convention Update!\nHappening Now: Did you know? The last prize has changed! Try your luck at Cosshoppe and get a mystery bag. What awaits inside is your prize!\n\nComing UP Next: \n1:00pm Cosplay Auction\n2:15pm Performance by Xylia Skylark\n2:30pm Anisong It Singing Contest\n3:30pm Cosplayer Guest Q&A: Kiyo\n3:45pm Doujin Cosplay Duo\n4:30pm Performance by As*Fire\n4:45pm Trivia Game: Ano Na Wa\n5:40pm Cosplay Carnival 2026 Special Guests Reveal\n5:45pm Awarding Ceremony\n6:00pm Cosplay Auction & Open Mic Karaoke\n\nDay 2 and Day 3 Regular Tickets are already SOLD OUT, but Shopper's Pass (6pm-8pm entry) are still available! You can get tickets and other event information at https://t.co/gXM5tvBWFH\n\nRevel in the snowy splendor of ⛩️ Cosplay Matsuri 2025 ⛩️: Winter Wonderland on December 28-30, 2025 in Function Rooms 2-5 at the SMX Convention Center Manila, Pasay City. Enjoy the Seasons of Cosplay unfold as we celebrate 25 years of cosplay together!\n\n#cosplay #cosplayph #cosplaymatsuri2025",
